# UI architecture

Full standard: `docs/ui-architecture.md`. Follow it for every web change.

- Server Components by default. `'use client'` only on **new** files that need hooks or browser events.
- **Never** add or remove `'use client'` on an existing file. Create a new module instead.
- `page.tsx` imports one RSC screen. Farm `[farmId]` content screens must not import `'use client'` modules (webpack `undefined.call`). Admin pages may hydrate a client island. Layout chrome (`FarmShell`) already has client nav.
- RSC must import icons from `components/ui/Icons.tsx`. Do not import `AdminIcons.tsx` from server files.
- Do not pass access tokens into client props. Client uses `useSession`; server uses `getSession` / `requireCurrentFarm`.
- Farm `[farmId]` URLs use exact id (`requireCurrentFarm`). No fallback to another farm. Only `/farm` redirects.
- Farm `[farmId]` content uses `components/ui` (`Dialog`, `DataTable`, `PageHeader`, `FilterBar`, `StatGrid`, `ActionButton`, `Icons`). Admin client islands keep header/stats/toolbar CSS on the island and use `AdminDialog` for modals. Do not import farm kit layout CSS into admin islands.
- If webpack throws `undefined.call`, stop `next dev`, delete `apps/web/.next`, restart, hard-refresh.
